Markdown-published insights articles live here, one file per post.

To publish: add <slug>.md in this directory AND a matching metadata
entry (same slug) in src/content/blogPosts.ts. The page at
/insights/<slug> renders the markdown with the house article styling
(see src/views/blog/MarkdownPost.tsx). Hand-built TSX posts in
postComponents take precedence over a markdown file with the same slug.

This file is named .keep so the directory exists in git without being
picked up by the *.md glob.
